    <mxCell id="title" value="&lt;b&gt;BUSTRAC HUB — Entity-Relationship Diagram (Corrected v2)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;PouchDB / CouchDB offline-first · 17 entities · 25 relationships" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=17;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="60" y="20" width="1100" height="56" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;Document envelope (every entity):&lt;/b&gt; _id (UUID) = physical PK · _rev · type (Mango query discriminator) · createdAt · updatedAt · isArchived. Logical *_id attributes below are secondary/business keys.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;No referential integrity in NoSQL:&lt;/b&gt; FK validity is enforced application-side on write; AuditLog is the actor/trace fallback. Where the app currently stores username strings (createdBy, approvedBy, author), the FK shown is the target model — keep a denormalized *_name for display.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Polymorphic FK:&lt;/b&gt; AuditLog.entity_type + record_id may point to any transaction doc (certificate, blotter, event, relief, etc.)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=11;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="60" y="88" width="1060" height="130" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
